                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00468/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00365/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个由水泥浇筑成的斜坡，坡度约45度。任何物体自其底部沿坡面上升至顶部后将会获得约████倍的原速度。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>巴音郭楞蒙古自治州附近<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被整体移动至Site-CN-██异常物理学研究部门<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>是哪个白痴把全速的摩托车开上去的？要是让我找到你，实验翼区的全部重建费用必从你工资里扣。</em>——Dr.Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00365" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00365" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00365-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605927124" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597821914 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Aug 2020 07:25</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张有沙发字样的A4纸，任何视线与其接触的智人会认为该项目是沙发，通过监控摄像头观看无效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的休息室内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">还在Site-CN-10的休息室内</span>被愤怒的Dr. Su撕毁，残骸被确认无异常性质。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>愚人节快乐——Dr. S73ven L1u<br />
████，S73ven你搞的让我一屁股坐地上了！——愤怒的Dr. L███████<br />
Dr. S73ven L1u 已受到惩罚——站点主管████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00004" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00004-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5320644&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605927124" alt="Drstevensliu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5320644)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;">Drstevensliu</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585711193 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">01 Apr 2020 03:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目为Site-CN-10厕所中的部分门锁。在有人进入时有一定几率自动反锁并一段时间内无法在保持锁体完好状况下使用外力打开，当进入对象进入极度绝望状态下将自动打开。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的厕所<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被更换<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我终于知道为什么站点里的女员工都会怪力了</em>——特工Accipiter</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00211" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00211-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605927124" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;">Dr Aurora Owl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589848038 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 May 2020 00:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00222/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张10m的裹尸布。当项目与一处于醉酒状态的人类个体处在一个单独的空间内时，项目将会瞬移至对象的身边，并完全包裹住对象的身体。期间对象能够正常呼吸但报告称感受到持续的“窒息感”。在异常效应显现十分钟后对象将会直接死亡，经鉴定死亡原因为窒息而死。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>████/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>████<br />
<strong>目前状态：</strong>Site-CN-75的标准异常物品收容柜内。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00222" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00222" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00222-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3167340&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605927124" alt="Yoghurt-rescuer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3167340)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;">Yoghurt-rescuer</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590679306 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 15:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


